-- CloudFlow Pro - 50-tenant full Demo seed
-- Generated by scripts/generate-demo-seed.ps1. Do not hand-edit this file.
-- Generic seeds: 310 tenant tables receive 50 rows per tenant; 4 global tables receive 50 rows total.
-- H foundations add three disabled overtime types per active tenant; drafts, approvals, settlements and inventory events require real service operations.
